174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Smart Parking Occupancy Detection is a camera-based system designed to automatically identify vacant and occupied parking spaces, making parking management more efficient and convenient. It uses computer vision techniques to analyse images or live video footage of parking areas and determine the occupancy status of individual parking spaces. Python, YOLO and OpenCV are utilized for image processing and vehicle detection, while a web dashboard provides a clear visualization of available and occupied spaces. This system helps drivers quickly locate vacant parking spots, reducing the time spent searching for parking and minimizing unnecessary traffic congestion. It also reduces the need for manual monitoring and improves the overall utilization of existing parking facilities.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
